        "title": "Add Agentic Ads Lab trace generation in common",
        "summary": "A new module in `common/src/ads/` adds the `LabRunTrace` type and helper functions to convert run events into a readable Markdown format. The `labRunTraceEntries` function merges adjacent text chunks while keeping tool calls and results in order, and `labRunTraceMarkdown` renders the trace with step checks and friction reports. Truncation constants `LAB_TRACE_INPUT_CHARS` and `LAB_TRACE_OUTPUT_CHARS` limit the character count of individual tool inputs and outputs in the generated trace.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "advertisers",
        "evidence": "The diff adds `common/src/ads/agentic-ad-lab-trace.ts` containing the `labRunTraceEntries` function which maps events to text or tool entries, and `labRunTraceMarkdown` which formats those entries into a string, both validated by tests in `agentic-ad-lab-trace.test.ts`.",
