        "calls": 2,
        "title": "Agentic Ads Lab bench supports renamed repositories via formerly field",
        "summary": "The `LabBenchRepository` type in `common/src/ads/agentic-ad-lab-bench.ts` gains an optional formerly field, and the `repo` helper now accepts and conditionally includes this value. A new `labBenchNamed` helper checks if a repository name matches either the current `fullName` or the formerly value, and `labBenchEntry` now uses this helper instead of comparing only `fullName`. Two existing bench entries, `nextjs/saas-starter` and `vercel/chatbot`, are updated to record their previous GitHub names (`leerob/next-saas-starter` and `vercel/ai-chatbot` respectively) so that labs added under the old names still resolve to the correct pinned commit.",
